39","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_助攻语音-狂铁","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"莱西奥：完美操作\n狂铁：最佳组合","hasText":true,"duration":1.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06685648BEEDA1000183532343438323539.mp3"},{"id":"06794648BEEDA1000183133393431303034","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_助攻语音-狂铁","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"莱西奥：有我们在\n狂铁：不可能输","hasText":true,"duration":1.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06794648BEEDA1000183133393431303034.mp3"},{"id":"06620648BEEDA1000183633393830373534","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_低血量回城","category":"回城","seq":null,"text":"伤口可不是什么值得炫耀的事情","hasText":true,"duration":3.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06620648BEEDA1000183633393830373534.mp3"},{"id":"06624648BEEDA1000183733313236383339","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_idle语音1","category":"待机","seq":null,"text":"如果老船长在这里，会怎么做？","hasText":true,"duration":6.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06624648BEEDA1000183733313236383339.mp3"},{"id":"06949648BEEDA1000183639353035303332","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_击杀语音-米莱狄2","category":"击杀","seq":null,"text":"高塔会被怒火点燃！","hasText":true,"duration":1.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06949648BEEDA1000183639353035303332.mp3"},{"id":"06486648BEED91000183132303638353331","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_击杀语音-地面","category":"击杀","seq":null,"text":"（诶？）我还没出绝招呢！","hasText":true,"duration":2.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06486648BEED91000183132303638353331.mp3"},{"id":"06178648BEED91000183137363533323939","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_复活语音","category":"复活","seq":null,"text":"放弃这个词可不适合我！","hasText":true,"duration":3.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06178648BEED91000183137363533323939.mp3"},{"id":"06247648BEED91000183135333537353138","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_训练营彩蛋语音","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"除了脑子和胆子，一点运气也是必不可少的","hasText":true,"duration":4.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06247648BEED91000183135333537353138.mp3"},{"id":"06919648BEED91000183433383237383637","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_击杀语音-空中","category":"击杀","seq":null,"text":"干的不错，小火鹰！","hasText":true,"duration":1.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06919648BEED91000183433383237383637.mp3"},{"id":"06550648BEED91000183136373339303233","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_击杀语音-狂铁","category":"击杀","seq":null,"text":"论实力~还是我的火炮更胜一筹","hasText":true,"duration":4.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06550648BEED91000183136373339303233.mp3"},{"id":"06369648BEED81000183636343530303431","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_挑衅语音1","category":"挑衅","seq":null,"text":"我确实没什么大本事，但打败你，足够了。","hasText":true,"duration":4.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06369648BEED81000183636343530303431.mp3"},{"id":"06049648BEED81000183137363830323336","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_挑衅语音2","category":"挑衅","seq":null,"text":"炮弹经费有限，不值得在你这里浪费太多~","hasText":true,"duration":4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06049648BEED81000183137363830323336.mp3"},{"id":"06864648BEED81000183132313239383234","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_死亡语音3","category":"死亡","seq":null,"text":"这不是我的悲哀……这是我的选择……","hasText":true,"duration":4.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06864648BEED81000183132313239383234.mp3"},{"id":"06280648BEED81000183938313238363138","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_死亡语音4","category":"死亡","seq":null,"text":"我还有个合金弹头的邀约，没答复……","hasText":true,"duration":4.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06280648BEED81000183938313238363138.mp3"},{"id":"06834648BEED81000183130383330363438","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_死亡语音-狂铁","category":"死亡","seq":null,"text":"几年不见，你的锤子还是一样莽撞","hasText":true,"duration":3.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06834648BEED81000183130383330363438.mp3"},{"id":"06477648BEED71000183132353933323534","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_移动语音12","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"面朝大海，你会知道要往哪起航","hasText":true,"duration":3.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06477648BEED71000183132353933323534.mp3"},{"id":"06056648BEED71000183135343538383530","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_彩蛋移动语音14（4月放出）","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"或许有一天，我会应邀去看看合金弹头，以火鹰之名","hasText":true,"duration":4.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06056648BEED71000183135343538383530.mp3"},{"id":"06396648BEED71000183138343430333337","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_死亡语音1","category":"死亡","seq":null,"text":"我还是不如他……但我还是会站出来","hasText":true,"duration":5.7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06396648BEED71000183138343430333337.mp3"},{"id":"06390648BEED71000183132363633373332","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_死亡语音2","category":"死亡","seq":null,"text":"总会有……新的火鹰出现……","hasText":true,"duration":4.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06390648BEED71000183132363633373332.mp3"},{"id":"06103648BEED71000183334383930303438","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_彩蛋移动语音13","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"邀请函中提到的合金弹头，应该能让我的火炮威力大涨吧！","hasText":true,"duration":5.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06103648BEED71000183334383930303438.mp3"},{"id":"06393648BEED61000183131303831373933","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_移动语音11","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"在老船长回来之前，面具，就由我来保管吧。","hasText":true,"duration":5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06393648BEED61000183131303831373933.mp3"},{"id":"06967648BEED61000183130343036303538","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_移动语音10","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"英雄从来都不是一个名字，而是他所做的事","hasText":true,"duration":4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06967648BEED61000183130343036303538.mp3"},{"id":"06997648BEED61000183838333738303138","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_移动语音8","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"我曾经忘记面具下的人是谁……现在，我想起来了。","hasText":true,"duration":5.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06997648BEED61000183838333738303138.mp3"},{"id":"06071648BEED61000183138323539393637","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_移动语音7","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"吹口哨（水手号子旋律）","hasText":true,"duration":8.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06071648BEED61000183138323539393637.mp3"},{"id":"06940648BEED61000183533373737343237","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_移动语音9","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"有更弱小的人在身后，这就是我站在这里的理由","hasText":true,"duration":4.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06940648BEED61000183533373737343237.mp3"},{"id":"06265648BEED51000183732303730313439","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_移动语音2","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"海都有海都的规矩，外城有外城的活法","hasText":true,"duration":5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06265648BEED51000183732303730313439.mp3"},{"id":"06452648BEED51000183336363630353038","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_移动语音3","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"我们这里什么都缺，但是勇气，要多少有多少","hasText":true,"duration":5.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06452648BEED51000183336363630353038.mp3"},{"id":"06410648BEED51000183933363431353839","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_移动语音4","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"凡事少问“能不能”，问问自己，该不该","hasText":true,"duration":4.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06410648BEED51000183933363431353839.mp3"},{"id":"06238648BEED51000183135373933303036","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_移动语音6","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"海都有句老话——财产可能被夺走，信念却不能……虽然我也没什么财产","hasText":true,"duration":6.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06238648BEED51000183135373933303036.mp3"},{"id":"06917648BEED51000183532383937383637","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_移动语音5","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"在面对自我时找到弱点，在面对敌人时忘掉弱点","hasText":true,"duration":5.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06917648BEED51000183532383937383637.mp3"},{"id":"06586648BEED41000183132313932373937","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_大厅语音2","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"继承传奇之名，续写英雄之事！","hasText":true,"duration":12.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06586648BEED41000183132313932373937.mp3"},{"id":"06935648BEED41000183833363039383036","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_大厅语音1","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"别担心，火鹰来了！","hasText":true,"duration":11.9,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06935648BEED41000183833363039383036.mp3"},{"id":"06750648BEED41000183933313433343332","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_大厅语音3","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"我没有在演英雄，我只是在做自己","hasText":true,"duration":11.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06750648BEED41000183933313433343332.mp3"},{"id":"06763648BEED41000183136313830353635","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_出生语音","category":"台词","seq":null,"text":"我的名字吗？火鹰，莱西奥，喂那个扛炮的，随你怎么叫","hasText":true,"duration":6.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06763648BEED41000183136313830353635.mp3"},{"id":"06213648BEED41000183638343233303333","heroId":"112","skinId":"787","skinName":"火鹰船长","title":"莱西奥_火鹰船长_移动语音1","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"别担心，火鹰来了。在那段扮演的日子里，我经常这样说。","hasText":true,"duration":7,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/112/06213648BEED41000183638343233303333.mp3"}]